# Security headers for Netlify (and Cloudflare Pages) static hosting.
# GitHub Pages does not support custom headers — that's fine, the site
# still works; you just won't get these defense-in-depth headers there.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
